@startuml UC7_VisualizationPath_RASD
autonumber
title [UC7] Visualization of a Path

' =======================================================
' ACTORS & SYSTEM
' =======================================================
actor "User" as User
participant "BBP System" as System

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over User, System: Entry Condition: User has selected a path and pressed "View"

' =======================================================
' (a) SYSTEM SHOWS DETAILS
' =======================================================
User -> System: pressView(BikePath)

' Internal Action
note right of System: System retrieves all necessary aggregated \ndata (streets and their score)
System -> System: fetchAggregatedPathData(BikePath)

System --> User: displayPathDetails(pathData)

' =======================================================
' EXIT CONDITION
' =======================================================
User -> System: pressExit()
System --> User: returnToPreviousScreen()

note over User, System: Exit Condition: User closes the details view

@enduml